.SH NAME
CWE\-131 \- Incorrect Calculation of Buffer Size
.SH RANK
KEV\-referenced weakness. Not part of the 2025 CWE Top 25; documented here because it appears in the CISA KEV catalog.
.SH CLASSIFICATION
Class: KEV\-referenced weakness.
.SH DESCRIPTION
The product does not correctly calculate the size to be used when allocating a buffer, which could lead to a buffer overflow.
